{"type":"message","id":"2afd35fb","parentId":"6c4abefc","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:19:57.527Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found it! Look at this critical log entry:\n\n```\n2026-05-28T16:16:50.989+08:00 info channels/feishu {\"subsystem\":\"channels/feishu\"} feishu[story-director]: blocked unauthorized sender ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2 (dmPolicy=open)\n```\n\nWait, it says `dmPolicy=open` but still blocked! That's weird. Let me look at what happened:\n\n1. User `ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2` sent a DM (in `oc_3624ca8491997b9c0ab52ef77a6b565c` - which is a p2p/DM chat)\n2. The gateway received it via feishu[story-director]\n3. BUT it was **blocked** - \"blocked unauthorized sender ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2 (dmPolicy=open)\"\n\nHmm, it says dmPolicy=open but still the sender was considered unauthorized? That seems like a bug or there's something else going on.\n\nActually wait - let me look at the dmPolicy definition more carefully:\n\nFrom the docs:\n- `\"open\"` - allow public DMs only when `allowFrom` includes `\"*\"`; with restrictive entries, only matching users can chat\n\nSo `dmPolicy: \"open\"` PLUS `allowFrom` is checked? The docs say: \"allow public DMs only when allowFrom includes '*'; with restrictive entries, only matching users can chat\"\n\nFor the story-director account, there's no explicit `allowFrom` set, so it defaults to... what? The parent level? Let me check.\n\nThe story-director account config:\n```json5\n\"story-director\": {\n  \"appId\": \"cli_aa9d51fb7dfb1bb3\",\n  \"appSecret\": \"***\",\n  \"domain\": \"feishu\",\n  \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n  \"dmPolicy\": \"open\",\n  \"groupPolicy\": \"open\",\n  \"groups\": {\n    \"*\": {\n      \"enabled\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"requireMention\": true\n}\n```\n\nThere's no `allowFrom` in the story-director account. The parent level feishu config has:\n```json5\n\"allowFrom\": [\"ou_22bcccc95a09d7521b0d7a59992738da\"]\n```\n\nSo when `dmPolicy: \"open\"` but no `allowFrom` with `\"*\"` in the account config, it may fall back to the parent's `allowFrom` which only has `ou_22bcccc95a09d7521b0d7a59992738da`.\n\nThe user `ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2` is not in the allowFrom list! So despite dmPolicy being \"open\", the allowFrom still restricts it.\n\nAccording to the docs:\n- `\"open\"` - allow public DMs only when `allowFrom` includes `\"*\"`; with restrictive entries, only matching users can chat\n\nSo with `dmPolicy: \"open\"` but `allowFrom` not including `\"*\"`, only users in `allowFrom` can chat. The user `ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2` is NOT in `allowFrom`.\n\nThe fix would be to either:\n1. Add `allowFrom: [\"*\"]` to the story-director account (allowing all users to DM)\n2. Or add `ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2` to the allowFrom\n\nLet me also check the parent-level allowFrom... actually, when the account doesn't have its own `allowFrom`, it likely inherits from the parent feishu config which only has `ou_22bcccc95a09d7521b0d7a59992738da`.\n\nSo the fix is to add `\"allowFrom\": [\"*\"]` to the story-director account config, or explicitly add the user's open_id.\n\nLet me also re-read the log more carefully: `blocked unauthorized sender ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2 (dmPolicy=open)` - it says dmPolicy=open but still blocked. So the dmPolicy being open still requires allowFrom to include the user (or \"*\").\n\nGiven the user wants me to handle this (\"你自己处理\"), let me fix it by adding `allowFrom: [\"*\"]` to the story-director account.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到根因了！日志清晰显示：\n\n```\nfeishu[story-director]: blocked unauthorized sender ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2 (dmPolicy=open)\n```\n\n**问题分析：** story-director 账号的 `dmPolicy: \"open\"` 但没有设 `allowFrom: [\"*\"]`，根据文档说明，`dmPolicy: \"open\"` 只有在 `allowFrom` 包含 `\"*\"` 时才真正开放所有人私聊。否则仍然走 `allowFrom` 列表过滤。当前 story-director 没设自己的 `allowFrom`，继承了父级的 `allowFrom: [\"ou_22bcccc95a09d7521b0d7a59992738da\"]`，而你的 ID 不在里面，所以私聊被拦截了。\n\n现在修复："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_1OjLQG1XNzdk3crjjRCC0922","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"config.patch","path":"channels.feishu.accounts.story-director.allowFrom","raw":"[\"*\"]"},"partialArgs":"{\"action\": \"config.patch\", \"path\": \"channels.feishu.accounts.story-director.allowFrom\", \"raw\": \"[\\\"*\\\"]\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"opencode-go","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":8369,"output":1315,"cacheRead":55424,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":1037,"totalTokens":65108,"cost":{"input":0.0011716600000000001,"output":0.0003682,"cacheRead":0.0001551872,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0016950472000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779956379365,"responseId":"f82df304-8310-4e3f-be6a-12d63f6744d7"}}
