{"type":"message","id":"8d9a9ecc","parentId":"00727ab3","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:20:43.538Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The gateway is restarting. When it comes back, I should update the user on what was done. But since I passed a continuationMessage, and the gateway is restarting, I should let the user know what happened when I get back.\n\nWait, the continuationMessage will be delivered after restart. But I'm still in this turn... Let me just respond with the diagnosis and fix summary.\n\nActually, the gateway restart will likely interrupt this session. Let me just make my final reply now summarizing what was done.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"诊断完毕，已修复。\n\n**根因：** story-director 的飞书账号（Nova）配置了 `dmPolicy: \"open\"` 但没设 `allowFrom`，实际继承了父级 `allowFrom`（只允许 `ou_22bcccc95a09d7521b0d7a59992738da`）。你的 open_id 是 `ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2`，不在列表里，私聊被拦截了。\n\n日志确认：\n```\nfeishu[story-director]: blocked unauthorized sender ou_5758c093caae0bf5f07fb3f26257d6b2 (dmPolicy=open)\n```\n\n**修复方式：** 在 story-director 账号配置里加了 `\"allowFrom\": [\"*\"]`，开放所有人私聊。Gateway 正在重启，重启后你私聊 Nova 发条消息试试。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"opencode-go","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":228,"output":311,"cacheRead":66816,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":103,"totalTokens":67355,"cost":{"input":0.00003192,"output":0.00008708,"cacheRead":0.0001870848,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0003060848}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779956436375,"responseId":"08b10f01-9634-4d2e-954c-e24b4e535ff8"}}
